      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.69,
          "en": "So the ultimate goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.69,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "is to make this place form Submittable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 8.78,
          "en": "For this, of course, it also needs a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.78,
          "end": 12.05,
          "en": "because at the moment there is no button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.05,
          "end": 14.93,
          "en": "Of course, we can add one here in place form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.93,
          "end": 17.45,
          "en": "below our inputs and our pickers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.45,
          "end": 19.84,
          "en": "We can add a button and for this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.84,
          "end": 23.27,
          "en": "I wanna build another custom button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.27,
          "end": 25.54,
          "en": "I have a icon button and a outlined button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.54,
          "end": 28.423,
          "en": "now I will add yet a never regular button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.3,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "Now in button JS, we can create a button component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 36.513,
          "en": "as we did it multiple times before and export it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 41.43,
          "en": "And then my button will be a pressable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.43,
          "end": 45.803,
          "en": "wrapped around some text, both imported from React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.29,
          "end": 48.83,
          "en": "The button should be configurable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.83,
          "end": 52.37,
          "en": "onPress is a prop that should be set from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.37,
          "end": 54.52,
          "en": "So from inside the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.52,
          "end": 57.62,
          "en": "where our custom button component is used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.62,
          "end": 60.79,
          "en": "and I get the children prop so that we can pass the caption",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.79,
          "end": 64.17,
          "en": "of the button between the button opening and closing tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.17,
          "end": 66.9,
          "en": "And then we can set onPress to onPress",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.9,
          "end": 71.68299999999999,
          "en": "and output children between our text, our component tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.05,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "Now, of course, we also need some styles here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 78.45,
          "en": "And for this, we will again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.45,
          "end": 80.76,
          "en": "of course create a style sheet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.76,
          "end": 84.1,
          "en": "And then as always, the exact look is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.1,
          "end": 86.68,
          "en": "but I wanna set up some styles for the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.68,
          "end": 89.35,
          "en": "for the pressed state off the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.35,
          "end": 91.513,
          "en": "and for the text of the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.28999999999999,
          "end": 94.75999999999999,
          "en": "Now, when the button is pressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.75999999999999,
          "end": 97.78,
          "en": "I simply wanna set opacity to 0.7",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.78,
          "end": 100.47,
          "en": "to have some slight transparency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.47,
          "end": 103.3,
          "en": "For the text, I wanna set the text aligned to center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.3,
          "end": 106.97,
          "en": "to center to text, and I wanna set the font size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.97,
          "end": 109.74000000000001,
          "en": "to 16 to ramp it up a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.74000000000001,
          "end": 111.59,
          "en": "And then for the button itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.59,
          "end": 113.85,
          "en": "there should be some horizontal padding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.85,
          "end": 115.75999999999999,
          "en": "let's say 12 pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.75999999999999,
          "end": 119.233,
          "en": "and some vertical padding of eight pixels,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.13,
          "end": 122.743,
          "en": "and a margin around the button of four pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 127.09,
          "en": "In addition, this button should have a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.09,
          "end": 129.24,
          "en": "which can be set to colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 129.24,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "imported from this colors constants file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 136.74,
          "en": "And the color I wanna choose here is primary 800",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.74,
          "end": 138.093,
          "en": "which is a dark blue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.95,
          "end": 142.99,
          "en": "The color of the text therefore should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.99,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "colors.primary50 which is a very light blue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 149.623,
          "en": "almost white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.98,
          "end": 152.16,
          "en": "Then I wanna add a shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.16,
          "end": 155.51,
          "en": "with elevation two and some shadow properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.51,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "for iOS like black as a shadow color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 163.623,
          "en": "then a shadow opacity of 0.15, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.9,
          "end": 166.87,
          "en": "a shadow offset,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.87,
          "end": 168.2,
          "en": "to the width of one pixel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.2,
          "end": 171.21,
          "en": "and height of one pixel, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.21,
          "end": 174.123,
          "en": "and a shadow radius of two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.17000000000002,
          "end": 178.9,
          "en": "Last but not least, I wanna add some rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.9,
          "end": 182.573,
          "en": "so we can set the border radius to four here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.85,
          "end": 185.29,
          "en": "And these are my button styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.29,
          "end": 187.08,
          "en": "of course you can bring your own styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.08,
          "end": 187.963,
          "en": "if you want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.47,
          "end": 191.18,
          "en": "With that we can add them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.18,
          "end": 194.34,
          "en": "So on pressable we used this function form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.34,
          "end": 195.86,
          "en": "as we did many times before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.86,
          "end": 198.34,
          "en": "to return an array of styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.34,
          "end": 202.07,
          "en": "where we always set the button style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.07,
          "end": 204.72,
          "en": "but then we check the pressed property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.72,
          "end": 208.88,
          "en": "and if it's true, we also add the pressed style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.88,
          "end": 212.53300000000002,
          "en": "And on the text, we of course set the text style.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.07,
          "end": 217,
          "en": "That's my custom button and I wanna use this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217,
          "end": 221.07,
          "en": "in the place form component below those pickers now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.07,
          "end": 223.56,
          "en": "So here we can and add the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.56,
          "end": 225.94,
          "en": "and of course therefore also add the import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 225.94,
          "end": 227.34300000000002,
          "en": "to this button component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.35,
          "end": 231.56,
          "en": "And then on this button or between the button tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 231.56,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "to be precise, I wanna say, \"add place,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 238.99,
          "en": "and then add the onPress prop, which should point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.99,
          "end": 242.5,
          "en": "at a function that is executed when this button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.5,
          "end": 245.913,
          "en": "And that will be the safe place handler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.76,
          "end": 248.32,
          "en": "This is the function responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.32,
          "end": 250.603,
          "en": "for saving the place on the device.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.68,
          "end": 255.32,
          "en": "However, right now we do get the title here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.32,
          "end": 258.64,
          "en": "We are saving that in the entered title state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.64,
          "end": 262.46,
          "en": "but we are not getting the picked image or location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.46,
          "end": 265.49,
          "en": "Those are used for preview purposes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 265.49,
          "end": 267.69,
          "en": "inside of the respective pickers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 267.69,
          "end": 269.21,
          "en": "but we're not passing the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.21,
          "end": 271.75,
          "en": "back to the place form component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.75,
          "end": 275.18,
          "en": "And of course, we should do this in order to store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.18,
          "end": 278.65999999999997,
          "en": "and ultimately submit the picked location, and image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.65999999999997,
          "end": 282.343,
          "en": "and to the chosen title from inside this place form.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
